.TH GAPI.CONF 5 "0.1.0-proto2m" "gapi" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
gapi.conf \- configuration file for gapi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configuration is read from gapi.conf in the search path, and every key may be
overridden by the environment variable named with it below.
.PP
Precedence is environment, then configuration file, then the default.
.SH SETTINGS
.TP
.B logging.file.compress
Type: bool.
Default: true.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_FILE_COMPRESS.
.TP
.B logging.file.enabled
Type: bool.
Default: false.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_FILE_ENABLED.
.TP
.B logging.file.maxAge
Type: int.
Default: 28.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_FILE_MAXAGE.
.br
Days
.TP
.B logging.file.maxBackups
Type: int.
Default: 3.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_FILE_MAXBACKUPS.
.br
Number of old files to keep
.TP
.B logging.file.maxSize
Type: int.
Default: 100.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_FILE_MAXSIZE.
.br
MB
.TP
.B logging.file.path
Type: string.
Default: /var/log/gapi/gapi.log.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_FILE_PATH.
.TP
.B logging.format
Type: string.
Default: json.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_FORMAT.
.br
json, console
.TP
.B logging.level
Type: string.
Default: info.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_LEVEL.
.br
trace, debug, info, warn, error
.TP
.B logging.loki.enabled
Type: bool.
Default: false.
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_LOKI_ENABLED.
.TP
.B logging.loki.url
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_LOGGING_LOKI_URL.
.TP
.B metrics.addr
Type: string.
Default: 127.0.0.1:10973.
Environment: GAPI_METRICS_ADDR.
.TP
.B metrics.enabled
Type: bool.
Default: false.
Environment: GAPI_METRICS_ENABLED.
.TP
.B security.verifyKey
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_SECURITY_VERIFYKEY.
.br
Path to public key
.TP
.B supervisor.noEarlyMounts
Type: bool.
Default: false.
Environment: GAPI_SUPERVISOR_NOEARLYMOUNTS.
.br
NoEarlyMounts skips the mount phase (the OCI runtime owns mounts in a container).
.TP
.B supervisor.pid1Mode
Type: bool.
Default: false.
Environment: GAPI_SUPERVISOR_PID1MODE.
.br
Pid1Mode activates the Phase-0 pre-userspace boot sequence (subreaper, PID-1 signals, kmsg, early mounts). Off by default: gapid runs as an ordinary supervisor unless it IS init.
.TP
.B supervisor.productionMode
Type: bool.
Default: false.
Environment: GAPI_SUPERVISOR_PRODUCTIONMODE.
.TP
.B supervisor.shutdown.gracePeriod
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_SUPERVISOR_SHUTDOWN_GRACEPERIOD.
.TP
.B supervisor.watchdog.device
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_SUPERVISOR_WATCHDOG_DEVICE.
.TP
.B supervisor.watchdog.enabled
Type: bool.
Default: false.
Environment: GAPI_SUPERVISOR_WATCHDOG_ENABLED.
.TP
.B supervisor.watchdog.interval
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_SUPERVISOR_WATCHDOG_INTERVAL.
.TP
.B timeouts.clientPending
Type: string.
Default: 2s.
Environment: GAPI_TIMEOUTS_CLIENTPENDING.
.TP
.B timeouts.clientTerminal
Type: string.
Default: 20s.
Environment: GAPI_TIMEOUTS_CLIENTTERMINAL.
.TP
.B timeouts.quicIdle
Type: string.
Default: 1m0s.
Environment: GAPI_TIMEOUTS_QUICIDLE.
.TP
.B timeouts.quicStream
Type: string.
Default: 10s.
Environment: GAPI_TIMEOUTS_QUICSTREAM.
.TP
.B timeouts.supervisorShutdown
Type: string.
Default: 5s.
Environment: GAPI_TIMEOUTS_SUPERVISORSHUTDOWN.
.TP
.B timeouts.supervisorStart
Type: string.
Default: 20s.
Environment: GAPI_TIMEOUTS_SUPERVISORSTART.
.TP
.B transport.address
Type: string.
Default: 127.0.0.1:29979.
Environment: GAPI_TRANSPORT_ADDRESS.
.TP
.B transport.insecureSkipVerify
Type: bool.
Default: true.
Environment: GAPI_TRANSPORT_INSECURESKIPVERIFY.
.TP
.B transport.tlsCa
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_TRANSPORT_TLSCA.
.TP
.B transport.tlsCert
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_TRANSPORT_TLSCERT.
.TP
.B transport.tlsKey
Type: string.
Default: (none).
Environment: GAPI_TRANSPORT_TLSKEY.
.TP
.B transport.type
Type: string.
Default: quic.
Environment: GAPI_TRANSPORT_TYPE.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gapid (1),
.BR gapictl (1)
